iv>  \r\n        <\/div>   \r\n      <\/div>  \r\n   <\/div>\r\n<\/div>      \r\n\r\n<\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-cfe9709 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default row-top\" data-eae-slider=\"23047\" data-id=\"cfe9709\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-bdc7059\" data-eae-slider=\"13035\" data-id=\"bdc7059\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-be60f00 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"be60f00\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"880\" src=\"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/image-13.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1027\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/image-13.jpg 800w, https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/image-13-768x845.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b600727\" data-eae-slider=\"54376\" data-id=\"b600727\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e14e7d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7e14e7d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About Gulf Oasis Travels & Tourism<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9138195 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9138195\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Gulf Oasis Travels & Tourism is a travel company with a headquarters in Dubai, United Arab Emirates that specializes in providing high-quality, culturally immersive travel experiences to destinations around the world. We are a team of travel experts who are passionate about exploring different cultures, traditions, and peoples, and we believe that travel can be a transformative experience that can broaden our perspectives and deepen our understanding of the world.<br \/><b>Global Reach<br \/><\/b>Gulf Oasis Travels & Tourism is a distinguished travel company operating in the UK, UAE, and the Philippines, catering to a diverse range of global clients. We are proud to provide exceptional travel experiences that are personalized to meet the unique preferences of each client. Our extensive global reach empowers us to leverage our expertise and connections to create unparalleled and authentic travel encounters.<br \/>With our strategically located offices across the world, we are well-equipped to offer our clients reliable and efficient services irrespective of their location. We specialize in serving B2B clients and are committed to delivering the highest level of service to help your business thrive.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-29e86ed elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default row-top\" data-eae-slider=\"96315\" data-id=\"29e86ed\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-19b3cda\" data-eae-slider=\"74726\" data-id=\"19b3cda\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-50762b2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"50762b2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our Commitment\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f4fce4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0f4fce4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>At Gulf Oasis Travels & Tourism, we are committed to providing authentic and personalized travel experiences that enable our clients to engage with the local cultures and communities of the places they visit. We work with local partners and guides who share our values and have a deep understanding and appreciation of their culture, and we strive to promote sustainable and responsible tourism practices that benefit both our clients and the local communities.<\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our services include customized itineraries, expert guidance, high-quality accommodations, comfortable transportation, and guided tours that allow our clients to experience the best that each destination has to offer. We offer a wide range of travel experiences, including cultural tours, adventure travel, wildlife safaris, spiritual journeys, and more.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Whether you&#8217;re a solo traveler, a group of friends, or a family looking for a unique and personalized travel experience, we are here to help you plan the journey of a lifetime.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-76fea9a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"76fea9a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our Vision\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f2a51d1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f2a51d1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>To become a leading global provider of high-quality, culturally immersive travel experiences that foster deeper understanding and appreciation of the world&#8217;s diverse cultures and peoples.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8259c01 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8259c01\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our Mission\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-acbabe7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"acbabe7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Gulf Oasis Travels & Tourism is committed to creating unforgettable travel experiences that enable our clients to explore the world with curiosity, respect, and open-mindedness. We strive to offer exceptional service, expert guidance, and personalized attention to ensure our clients have a safe, enjoyable, and authentic journey. Through our partnerships with local communities, sustainable tourism practices, and educational opportunities, we aim to promote cross-cultural understanding, environmental stewardship, and positive social impact.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b88cfd0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b88cfd0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Choose Gulf Oasis Travels & Tourism?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f536d59 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f536d59\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Gulf Oasis Travels & Tourism<\/strong> offers several unique advantages and benefits that make us stand out from other travel companies.\u00a0<\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Cultural immersion<\/strong><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gulf Oasis Travels & Tourism is committed to providing authentic and immersive travel experiences that allow our clients to truly engage with the local cultures, customs, and traditions of the places they visit. We work with local guides and partners who have a deep understanding and appreciation of their culture, and who can provide insights and perspectives that go beyond what you might find in a guidebook.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Personalized attention<\/strong><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We believe that every traveler is unique and has their own interests, preferences, and needs. That&#8217;s why we offer personalized attention and tailor-made itineraries that can be customized to your specific interests and budget. We take the time to listen to your needs and work with you to create a travel experience that meets your expectations.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Expert guidance<\/strong><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our team of travel experts has years of experience in the travel industry, and we have personally visited many of the destinations we offer. We are passionate about travel and are committed to providing expert guidance and support throughout your journey, from planning and booking to on-the-ground assistance.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Sustainable &amp; responsible tourism<\/strong><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At Gulf Oasis Travels & Tourism, we are committed to promoting sustainable and responsible tourism practices that minimize the impact on the environment and maximize the benefits for local communities. We work with local partners who share our values and are committed to ethical and sustainable tourism practices.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Quality service<\/strong><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We believe that quality service is the key to a successful travel experience. That&#8217;s why we go above and beyond to ensure that every aspect of your journey is seamless and stress-free. From comfortable and safe transportation to high-quality accommodations and expertly guided tours, we strive to provide exceptional service that exceeds your expectations.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Gulf Oasis Travels & Tourism offers unique and unparalleled travel experiences, We are passionate about travel and are committed to creating unforgettable journeys that will leave you with lasting memories and a deeper understanding and appreciation of the world around you.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-62792c4 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default row-top\" data-eae-slider=\"49586\" data-id=\"62792c4\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7fbf158\" data-eae-slider=\"33046\" data-id=\"7fbf158\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-849f753 elementor-widget elementor-widget-gva-heading-block\" data-id=\"849f753\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"gva-heading-block.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gva-element-gva-heading-block gva-element\">   <div class=\"align-center style-1 widget gsc-heading box-align-left auto-responsive